1
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,030
My Lord.

2
00:02:08,229 --> 00:02:09,330
I got it back.

3
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,290
It wasn't a wasted trip.

4
00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,400
Divine power takes time to nurture.

5
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,060
Memories take time to recall.

6
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:24,060
No rush.

7
00:02:24,930 --> 00:02:26,590
I've waited 300 years anyway.

8
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:39,829
Are you awake?

9
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,430
Wife.

10
00:02:43,930 --> 00:02:46,130
I dreamt you made me eight dishes.

11
00:02:46,329 --> 00:02:47,530
I was just eating the seventh one

12
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:48,930
when you kicked me awake.

13
00:02:49,130 --> 00:02:51,660
Why did the wound on your arm split open again?

14
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:54,430
I probably pressed on it when I turned over at night.

15
00:02:54,430 --> 00:02:55,030
It's fine.

16
00:02:55,329 --> 00:02:56,560
I have thick skin.

17
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,800
Did you go into the water last night?

18
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:04,660
No.

19
00:03:05,130 --> 00:03:06,460
I slept perfectly fine.

20
00:03:09,130 --> 00:03:10,860
Your hair is still wet.

21
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:18,300
I felt hot in the middle of the night.

22
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:19,829
So I went down to take a bath.

23
00:03:21,230 --> 00:03:22,730
I remember last night.

24
00:03:22,730 --> 00:03:24,030
We rescued the deer.

25
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:25,590
And suddenly I fainted.

26
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:28,730
Yes.

27
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,600
It must be the exhaustion from the journey during the day.

28
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,200
You fainted from tiredness.

29
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,360
Cangyuan.

30
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,560
If you lie to me,

31
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:39,930
we have nothing more to say to each other.

32
00:03:39,930 --> 00:03:41,530
Nothing really happened.

33
00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:45,860
Wife.

34
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:48,560
Actually, I was making this wooden hairpin for you.

35
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,060
I saw you lost yours.

36
00:03:50,060 --> 00:03:52,260
So I wanted to secretly make one for you.

37
00:03:52,329 --> 00:03:53,660
Maybe I used too much force.

38
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:55,200
That's why the wound split open.

39
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,260
I originally planned to give it to you on your birthday.

40
00:03:58,829 --> 00:04:00,030
It's carved from ebony.

41
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:01,090
It looks ordinary.

42
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:02,600
But wearing it nourishes your hair.

43
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,200
You roll in the hay every day.

44
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:06,460
Your hair is so rough it could cut hands.

45
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:09,160
Where did this ugly hairpin come from?

46
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:09,760
Ugly?

47
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,300
If it's ugly, I'll throw it away.

48
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,560
I'll get you a gold one later.

49
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,260
Don't throw it away, since you already made it.

50
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:15,390
I'll make do with it.

51
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:25,060
Wife.

52
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:26,830
It looks very beautiful.

53
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:28,760
Although the hairpin is ordinary,

54
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,760
the person wearing it is beautiful.

55
00:04:30,860 --> 00:04:33,330
Who knows if you broke it off some dead tree.

56
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:35,159
The carving is too poor.

57
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,560
Your Majesty.

58
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,730
The lockdown order has been issued.

59
00:04:41,730 --> 00:04:43,930
Secret sentries have been placed at all exits of the Demon Realm.

60
00:04:43,930 --> 00:04:44,659
In addition,

61
00:04:44,659 --> 00:04:45,530
spies report

62
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,130
that the water color of Qiyue Lake in the western border of the Demon Realm is changing.

63
00:04:48,130 --> 00:04:50,960
It is suspected that a spiritual object is maturing.

64
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:51,900
Qiyue Lake.

65
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:54,230
According to investigations,

66
00:04:54,230 --> 00:04:55,800
there is a Soul-Returning Grass at the bottom of the lake.

67
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,960
It will mature soon.

68
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:58,730
This grass can replenish divine veins

69
00:04:58,730 --> 00:04:59,860
and awaken godhood.

70
00:05:00,130 --> 00:05:01,660
If Bai Li gets this grass...

71
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:05,720
We can't let her get it.

72
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:06,660
Pass down the order.

73
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:08,030
Send someone to Qiyue Lake.

74
00:05:08,030 --> 00:05:09,030
Destroy the grass.

75
00:05:09,030 --> 00:05:10,260
And eliminate the person.

76
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:11,460
Before she recovers,

77
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,360
get it done.

78
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:23,560
Bai Li.
